    {
      "msgid": "setupTooltipView/tip",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "You can switch between Main Configuration and Alternate Configuration of the vehicle in the Garage and during the pre-battle countdown.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "setupTooltipView/title",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Alternate Configuration: {name}",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/additionalEquipment/description",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "%(accent)Auxiliary Loadout%(/accent) is a part of the vehicle configuration that consists of %(accent)equipment and directives%(/accent). After accessing Alternate Configuration, you can %(accent)switch between configurations%(/accent) of the Auxiliary Loadout during the pre-battle countdown.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/additionalEquipment/title",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "AUXILIARY LOADOUT",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/alternativeEquipment/description",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "After reaching a certain Field Modification Level, an %(accent)Alternate Configuration%(/accent) will be available for your vehicle and you will be able to prepare %(accent)an additional set of equipment, ammunition, consumables, and directives%(/accent) in the Garage. It does not replace the main one, but it unlocks new opportunities. You can evaluate the map and team compositions during the pre-battle countdown and %(accent)select one of two%(/accent) vehicle configurations. It will allow you to better prepare for the upcoming battle conditions.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/alternativeEquipment/title",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "ALTERNATE VEHICLE CONFIGURATION",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/baseModifications/description",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "%(accent)Standard modifications%(/accent) add a bonus to %(accent)one of the vehicle's characteristics%(/accent) and unlock Dual Modifications. These modifications are free to install, and you need Combat Experience or Free Experience to research them.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/baseModifications/title",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "STANDARD MODIFICATIONS",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/extraModification/description",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "%(accent)Special Modifications%(/accent) unlock Alternate Configuration for the vehicle and allow to %(accent)assign a category%(/accent) to the second equipment slot (for Tier VIII–X vehicles). You can reassign the selected slot category using credits.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/extraModification/title",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "SPECIAL MODIFICATIONS: ROLE SLOT",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/fieldModernization/description",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Field Modification is the ability to perform a more nuanced configuration of the vehicle according to its role and %(accent)change its characteristics%(/accent) using various %(accent)modifications%(/accent). Each subsequent modification is unlocked after researching the previous one.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/fieldModernization/infoTitle",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "FIELD MODIFICATION",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/fieldModernization/title",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "CHANGING VEHICLE CHARACTERISTICS",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/modificationTree/description",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "The Modification Tree is available for %(accent)Tier VI–X%(/accent) researchable and Collectors' vehicles that have acquired %(accent)Elite status%(/accent). Modifications for special, prize, reward, and Premium vehicles are available after purchase.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/modificationTree/infoTitle",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "RESEARCHING MODIFICATIONS",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/modificationTree/title",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "RESEARCHING MODIFICATIONS",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/pairedModifications/description",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "%(accent)Dual Modifications improve one%(/accent) of the vehicle's characteristics and %(accent)decrease another%(/accent). You need Combat Experience or Free Experience to research modifications and credits to install them. You can %(accent)cancel (remove from the vehicle)%(/accent) the modification %(accent)for free%(/accent).\nWhen the vehicle is sold, Standard and Special Modifications are saved, but Dual Modifications are cancelled.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/pairedModifications/title",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "DUAL MODIFICATIONS",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/requiredEquipment/description",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "%(accent)Essentials Loadout%(/accent) is a part of the vehicle configuration that consists of %(accent)ammunition and consumables%(/accent). After accessing Alternate Configuration, you can %(accent)switch between configurations%(/accent) of the Essentials Loadout during the pre-battle countdown.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/requiredEquipment/title",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "ESSENTIALS LOADOUT",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/roleInBattle/description",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Unlike the vehicle type, the role of the vehicle more accurately reflects the optimal %(accent)battle tactics%(/accent) and defines what %(accent)Modification Tree%(/accent) will be available for a particular vehicle.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/roleInBattle/title",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "VEHICLE'S ROLE IN BATTLE",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/specialModifications/description/1/text",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Modifications change a vehicle's characteristics, unlock %(accent)access to Alternate Configuration%(/accent), and allow to assign a category to the %(accent)second slot%(/accent) for equipment.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/specialModifications/description/2/text",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Alternate Configuration is a second set of %(accent)equipment, ammunition, consumables, and directives%(/accent). You can switch between configurations.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/specialModifications/description/3/text",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "The ability to select and assign a category for the %(accent)second slot%(/accent) for equipment. Directly affects the vehicle's efficiency in battle.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "slides/specialModifications/title",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "MODIFICATIONS, ALTERNATE CONFIGURATION, SLOT CATEGORY",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
